1
00:00:00,647 --> 00:00:03,527
(Bernadette:)I'm too small for Twister.
And roller coasters.

2
00:00:03,691 --> 00:00:05,941
(Bernadette:)And sitting with my feet on the floor.

3
00:00:07,362 --> 00:00:11,072
(Bernadette:)Hope you enjoyed
the prenatal cigarettes, mom.

4
00:00:13,451 --> 00:00:16,081
Hey, my mom smoked pot
when she was pregnant with me...

5
00:00:16,246 --> 00:00:17,706
(Penny:)...and I turned out just fine.

6
00:00:17,872 --> 00:00:21,002
(Penny:)Hey, look, I have peach schnapps.
Thank God.

7
00:00:21,835 --> 00:00:24,545
- Guys, something happened.
- What's wrong?

8
00:00:24,712 --> 00:00:27,342
(Amy:)I think a boy likes me.

9
00:00:28,341 --> 00:00:31,721
"Hi. It's Stuart.
We met at the comic book store.

10
00:00:31,886 --> 00:00:35,636
(Bernadette(reading):)I was wondering if you'd like to get
coffee sometime. It's okay if you say no.

11
00:00:35,807 --> 00:00:39,937
(Bernadette(reading):)It might be the kick in the pants I need
to start taking Zoloft."

12
00:00:41,479 --> 00:00:43,059
Amy, you little vixen.

13
00:00:43,231 --> 00:00:46,271
(Penny:)Just working it under all those layers
of wool and polyester.

14
00:00:48,027 --> 00:00:50,907
What are you gonna do?
Doesn't he know you have a boyfriend?

15
00:00:51,072 --> 00:00:54,242
(Penny:)Oh, she doesn't have a boyfriend,
she has a Sheldon.

